  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "For the company, the first step is to look at the order."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the order is to be rejected, the process should continue. If the order is to be accepted, the process should also continue."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "At the same time, two steps need to be completed: preparing the assembling order and checking availability."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If there is a backorder, availability needs to be checked again and the process ends."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the item can be reserved, the process should continue."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "The next steps are to assemble the bike and then ship the product."
